segments.text:
As I entered the bathroom, I noticed some lights moving; upon closer inspection, I realized these lights had a similar appearance to a star; I went to grab my phone and managed to record it; the stars in the background and the object disappearing into the sky prove it; they are not planes because the route is more towards the east;

USER DESCRIPTION:

Neither is it a plane flying horizontally and vertically or turning off its lights, drone.
